
/*
QUERY NAME: Fall 2026 Course Identification

PURPOSE:
Retrieves Blackboard Learn courses whose course numbers
contain the pattern '2026_FA' and have not been marked
as deleted.

DATA SOURCE:
CDM_LMS.COURSE
Contains course information from Blackboard Data - Illuminate.

FIELDS RETURNED:
- course_id     : Unique internal course identifier (COURSE.ID).
- course_number : Course number assigned to the course
                  in Blackboard Learn.

FILTERING CONDITIONS:
1. course_number ILIKE '%2026_FA%'
   Includes courses whose course numbers match the
   specified pattern, regardless of capitalization.

   - ILIKE performs a case-insensitive pattern match.
   - % allows any number of characters before or after
     the specified pattern.
   - The underscore (_) in SQL LIKE/ILIKE is a wildcard
     matching exactly one character, not a literal
     underscore.

   IMPORTANT:
   The pattern '2026_FA' will match course numbers such as:
   - 2026_FA_BIOL101
   - ABC_2026_FA_MATH101
   - 2026-FA-ENG101

   To match a literal underscore between 2026 and FA,
   use an escaped underscore in the search pattern.

2. row_deleted_time IS NULL
   Excludes courses that have been marked as deleted
   in Blackboard Data - Illuminate.

SORTING:
- No ORDER BY clause is specified.
- Results are not guaranteed to appear in any
  particular order.

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- The query identifies courses using their course number,
  not an academic term relationship or date range.
- The pattern '2026_FA' is assumed to represent Fall 2026
  based on the course naming convention.
- The query does not verify course availability or
  enabled status.
- Both active and inactive courses may be returned,
  provided they have not been marked as deleted.
- No course start date or end date restrictions apply.
- The course_id alias represents the internal COURSE.ID,
  not the Blackboard course number.
- Results may change as course records are added,
  updated, or marked as deleted.

*/

SELECT 
    c.id AS course_id,
    c.course_number
FROM 
    CDM_LMS.COURSE c
WHERE 
    c.course_number ILIKE '%2026_FA%'
    AND c.row_deleted_time IS NULL;
